WEBVTT

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:01.607
Let's do the harder work
of mentoring those

00:06:01.607 --> 00:06:04.902
who do not show up
on our organizational charts.

00:06:06.112 --> 00:06:11.158
Let's understand their aspirations
and connect them to opportunities,

00:06:11.158 --> 00:06:13.035
even if those are outside our firms.

00:06:15.371 --> 00:06:16.622
Next.

00:06:17.331 --> 00:06:24.338
Let's get rid of the idea that a smart app
or gadget or technology or business model

00:06:24.547 --> 00:06:26.006
will fix injustice.

00:06:26.048 --> 00:06:27.299
It will not!

00:06:27.341 --> 00:06:28.926
(Applause)